          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "પસ્તાવું — pastāvũ — \"to regret\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "જો તમે આ તક ખોશો તો પછી પસ્તાશો. jo tame ā tak khośo to pachī pastāśo. If you lose this chance, you will regret it later."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he …): તે પોતાની ભૂલ પર પસ્તાયો, te potānī bhūl par pastāyo."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "પસ્તાવું (pastāvũ) CDIAL lists the Gujarati word under a reconstructed paścōttāpa, \"repentance\" (CDIAL 8010), which is built from paścāt, \"after\", and tāpa, \"burning\": the heat that comes afterwards."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
